# Feedback

## Help us improve the courses

The Understanding Metadata courses are currently in beta, and we are keen to hear from people who have used them.

All feedback is welcome and greatly appreciated. Your responses will help us improve the courses and ensure they are as useful and easy to understand. 
as possible. Contributors may be acknowledged in the project where appropriate.

If you can spare around 10 minutes, please complete our short feedback survey:

[Leave your feedback](https://qualtrics.ucl.ac.uk/jfe/form/SV_a4y7ldYQWtpY9AG){ .md-button }

## Improvements and bugs

Alternatively, if you find any errors or want to suggest improvements, please [post an issue at the github repository here](https://github.com/CLOSER-Cohorts/understanding-metadata/issues). We will add you to the list of contributors


